  {"id": "document:packages/client/ui-settings-session-log/README.md", "type": "document", "name": "README.md", "filePath": "packages/client/ui-settings-session-log/README.md", "summary": "ui-settings-session-log 包参考文档：General 设置中\"使用官方模型 API 时上传 Session log\"开关，经共享配置表单编辑 Host 插件 enabled 字段，保存失败保留已接受值并用存活的 toast 提示。", "tags": ["documentation", "package-reference", "session-log", "settings"], "complexity": "simple"},
  {"id": "config:packages/client/ui-settings-session-log/package.json", "type": "config", "name": "package.json", "filePath": "packages/client/ui-settings-session-log/package.json", "summary": "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-settings-session-log 包清单：注入 locale/ui-settings/ui-layout。", "tags": ["configuration", "package-manifest", "client-plugin"], "complexity": "simple"},
  {"id": "file:packages/client/ui-settings-session-log/src/client/UploadRow.tsx", "type": "file", "name": "UploadRow.tsx", "filePath": "packages/client/ui-settings-session-log/src/client/UploadRow.tsx", "summary": "API 日志上传设置行与持久 toast：行内 Switch 显示已接受 Host 设置（busy/未就绪/只读时禁用），toast 在 Settings 关闭后仍显示保存结果并按 sequence 惰性消退。", "tags": ["react-component", "settings-row", "toast"], "complexity": "simple"},
  {"id": "function:packages/client/ui-settings-session-log/src/client/UploadRow.tsx:UploadRow", "type": "function", "name": "UploadRow", "filePath": "packages/client/ui-settings-session-log/src/client/UploadRow.tsx", "lineRange": [26, 38], "summary": "渲染已接受的上传状态行：checked 取 upload.value?.enabled === true，写入走 setEnabled 不做乐观更新（表单保留已接受态）。", "tags": ["react-component", "exported"], "complexity": "simple"},
  {"id": "function:packages/client/ui-settings-session-log/src/client/UploadRow.tsx:UploadToast", "type": "function", "name": "UploadToast", "filePath": "packages/client/ui-settings-session-log/src/client/UploadRow.tsx", "lineRange": [45, 50], "summary": "渲染保存结果 toast：notice 为 null 不渲染，saved 用 success 色调，动画结束回调 dismiss。", "tags": ["react-component", "toast", "exported"], "complexity": "simple"},
  {"id": "file:packages/client/ui-settings-session-log/src/client/index.ts", "type": "file", "name": "index.ts", "filePath": "packages/client/ui-settings-session-log/src/client/index.ts", "summary": "浏览器伴生入口：注册 settings.sessionLog 八语词典，whileServed 守护下把 UploadRow 挂入 settings.general.item（order 90），UploadToast 常驻 shell.overlay；inject ['slots','locale','configForms']。", "tags": ["entry-point", "cordis-plugin", "slot-registration"], "complexity": "moderate"},
  {"id": "function:packages/client/ui-settings-session-log/src/client/index.ts:apply", "type": "function", "name": "apply", "filePath": "packages/client/ui-settings-session-log/src/client/index.ts", "lineRange": [25, 41], "summary": "伴生插件体：new UploadPreference(ctx.configForms.get('session-log-deepseek'))，face 工厂暴露 upload/mutation 两个 hook 与 setEnabled/dismiss；行注册走 whileServed，toast 注册不受守护。", "tags": ["cordis-plugin", "effect-registration", "exported"], "complexity": "moderate"},
  {"id": "file:packages/client/ui-settings-session-log/src/client/upload-preference.ts", "type": "file", "name": "upload-preference.ts", "filePath": "packages/client/ui-settings-session-log/src/client/upload-preference.ts", "summary": "有序偏好写入与设置面板外存活的提示：UploadPreference 持 busy/notice/sequence 变更状态快照 store，写 Host 设置不发布乐观上传态。", "tags": ["preference-store", "mutation-state"], "complexity": "simple"},
  {"id": "class:packages/client/ui-settings-session-log/src/client/upload-preference.ts:UploadPreference", "type": "class", "name": "UploadPreference", "filePath": "packages/client/ui-settings-session-log/src/client/upload-preference.ts", "lineRange": [18, 50], "summary": "写 Host 设置的偏好封装：setEnabled 在 busy 时直接返回，form.set 异常被吞（表单保留已接受态），完成后按 accepted 置 saved/failed 提示并递增 sequence；dismiss 只清提示。Service Consumer（消费 configForms 的 ConfigForm）。", "tags": ["preference-store", "service-consumer", "exported"], "complexity": "simple"},
  {"id": "file:packages/client/ui-settings-session-log/src/css-modules.d.ts", "type": "file", "name": "css-modules.d.ts", "filePath": "packages/client/ui-settings-session-log/src/css-modules.d.ts", "summary": "CSS Modules 类型 shim：declare module '*.module.css'。", "tags": ["type-definition", "css-modules"], "complexity": "simple"},
